      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it might simplify listener impl like\n```\n                new PortsStateManager.Listener() {\n                    @Override\n                    void onActivePortsUpdated(Set\u003cInteger\u003e oldPorts, Set\u003cInteger\u003e newPorts) {\n                        updateListeningPorts();\n                    }\n\n                    @Override\n                    void onPortEnabled(int port) {\n                        updateListeningPorts();\n                    }\n\n                    @Override\n                    void onPortDisabled(int port) {\n                        updateListeningPorts();\n                    }\n                };\n```\nbecomes `(port, old, new) \u003d\u003e udpateListeningPorts();`\n\n\n```\n                new PortsStateManager.Listener() {\n                    @Override\n                    void onActivePortsUpdated(Set\u003cInteger\u003e oldPorts, Set\u003cInteger\u003e newPorts) {\n                        Set\u003cInteger\u003e union \u003d new HashSet\u003c\u003e(oldPorts);\n                        union.addAll(newPorts);\n                        for (int port : union) {\n                            if (!oldPorts.contains(port)) {\n                                showNotificationFor(port);\n                            } else if (!newPorts.contains(port)) {\n                                discardNotificationFor(port);\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                };\n```\nbecomes\n\n```\n(port, old, new) \u003d\u003e {\n  if (old^new \u0026 PortState.ACTIVE !\u003d 0) {\n    if (new \u0026 PortState.ACTIVE !\u003d 0) shownotification else discardnotification\n  }\n}\n```",
